      "claim": "Lu 25-109, which shares the same 1-methyl-1,2,3,6-tetrahydropyridin-4-yl substituent and a five-membered heteroaromatic core as the query, entered the brain in a 1:1 ratio with blood in rat microdialysis, directly supporting meaningful CNS access.",
