    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C05"],
      "claim": "[18F]MK-1312 showed high brain uptake and rapid accumulation in all gray matter regions in rhesus monkey PET, providing strong in vivo evidence that related lipophilic heteroaromatic compounds achieve meaningful CNS access.",
